// Generate a random float and convert it to several fp<S,E,M> formats.
// Constraints: S+E+M <= 16. We exercise a few valid template combos to maximize coverage.
float f = *FUZZ_PARAM(float);

// Common 16-bit-like encodings (sign=1, exponent≈5, mantissa varying)
// These exercise clamping/rounding paths for various mantissa widths.
